  m_Text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    WASD / Arrow keys: Move

    SPACE: Jump


    Two jumps
    per attempt.

    Land before jumping again.


    Cyan pickup: Shield

    Yellow
    pickup: Speed boost


    Avoid defenders and reach

    the far end to score
    a try!'
